<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>法院公告</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
    background: #F0F2F5;
    color: #1D2129;
    font-size: 14px;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }

  /* 弹窗容器 */
  .modal {
    max-width: 1720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* 弹窗头部 */
  .modal-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E6EB;
  }
  .modal-header .title {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1D2129;
  }
  .modal-header .close-btn {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: #86909C;
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 1;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: all .15s;
    user-select: none;
    background: none;
    border: none;
  }
  .modal-header .close-btn:hover {
    background: #F2F3F5;
    color: #1D2129;
  }

  /* 详情表格 */
  .detail-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;
  }
  .detail-table th,
  .detail-table td {
    border: 1px solid #E5E6EB;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    vertical-align: middle;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .detail-table th {
    background: #F7F8FA;
    color: #4E5969;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
    width: 110px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .detail-table td {
    color: #1D2129;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* 当事人 */
  .party-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .party-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: #1D2129;
  }
  .party-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 2px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    white-space: nowrap;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .party-tag.defendant {
    background: #FFECE8;
    color: #F53F3F;
  }
  .party-tag.plaintiff {
    background: #E8F3FF;
    color: #165DFF;
  }
  .party-avatar {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #E8F3FF;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .party-avatar svg {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    color: #165DFF;
  }
  .party-name {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1D2129;
  }

  /* 公告内容行 */
  .content-row th {
    vertical-align: top;
    padding-top: 24px;
  }
  .content-row td {
    vertical-align: top;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: #1D2129;
    text-align: justify;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="modal">
  <!-- 头部 -->
  <div class="modal-header">
    <div class="title">法院公告</div>
    <button class="close-btn" aria-label="关闭">×</button>
  </div>

  <!-- 详情表格 -->
  <table class="detail-table">
    <colgroup>
      <col style="width:110px">
      <col>
      <col style="width:110px">
      <col>
    </colgroup>
    <tbody>
      <!-- 第1行：案号 / 公告日期 -->
      <tr>
        <th>案号</th>
        <td>（2026）冀0129民初741号</td>
        <th>公告日期</th>
        <td>2026-08-19</td>
      </tr>

      <!-- 第2行：案由 / 当事人 -->
      <tr>
        <th>案由</th>
        <td>租赁合同纠纷</td>
        <th>当事人</th>
        <td>
          <div class="party-row">
            <div class="party-item">
              <span class="party-tag defendant">被告</span>
              <span class="party-avatar">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 12c2.21 0 4-1.79 4-4s-1.79-4-4-4-4 1.79-4 4 1.79 4 4 4zm0 2c-2.67 0-8 1.34-8 4v2h16v-2c0-2.66-5.33-4-8-4z"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="party-name">Z某某</span>
            </div>
            <div class="party-item">
              <span class="party-tag plaintiff">原告</span>
              <span class="party-name">郑州灰鲸网络科技有限公司</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </td>
      </tr>

      <!-- 第3行：公告类型 / 公告法院 -->
      <tr>
        <th>公告类型</th>
        <td>裁判文书</td>
        <th>公告法院</th>
        <td>赞皇县人民法院</td>
      </tr>

      <!-- 第4行：公告内容（跨列） -->
      <tr class="content-row">
        <th>公告内容</th>
        <td colspan="3">
          Z某某:本院受理原告郑州灰鲸网络科技有限公司诉被告Z某某租赁合同纠纷一案,因用其他方式无法送达,依照《中华人民共和国民事诉讼法》第九十五条的规定,向你公告送达（2026）冀0129民初741号民事判决书。本院判决:一、限本判决生效后十日内被告Z某某支付原告郑州灰鲸网络科技有限公司iPhone15ProMax黑色钛金属色256GB手机赔偿款（即买断款）8549.24元;二、驳回原告郑州灰鲸网络科技有限公司其他诉讼请求。自本公告刊登之日起,经过三十日即视为送达。如不服本判决,可在判决书送达之日起15日内,向本院递交上诉状,并按对方当事人的人数提出副本,上诉于石家庄市中级人民法院。逾期本判决即发生法律效力。
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

</body>
</html>
